+# CONTRACT — T7 Plugin Marketplace
+
+## Registry (`src/registry/index.ts` → `RegistryService`)
+- [ ] register(manifest) stores a manifest; multiple versions of same name coexist → register two versions, listVersions returns both
+- [ ] register replaces an existing (name,version) → re-register same version, list count unchanged, content updated
+- [ ] get(name) returns latest semver version or null if absent → get returns highest version
+- [ ] getVersion(name,version) returns exact manifest or null
+- [ ] list() returns all manifests across all names/versions
+- [ ] search(query) matches name/description/author case-insensitively
+- [ ] remove(name,version) deletes one version, returns true; false if absent; removing last version drops the name
+- [ ] listVersions(name) returns versions (empty array if none)
+- [ ] update(name,version,updates) merges partial fields; no-op if absent
+
+## Resolver (`src/resolver/index.ts` → `ResolverService`)
+- [ ] satisfies(version,range) wraps semver.satisfies
+- [ ] maxSatisfying(versions,range) returns best match or null
+- [ ] validRange(range) true for valid, false for invalid
+- [ ] resolve(constraints,available) returns ResolvedVersion (max match) per satisfiable constraint; unsatisfiable skipped
+
+## Runner (`src/runner/index.ts` → `RunnerService`)
+- [ ] execute(code) runs code in vm, returns {success:true, output, duration, memoryUsed}
+- [ ] execute passes context vars into sandbox → code reading a context var sees it
+- [ ] execute on throwing code returns {success:false, error}
+- [ ] executeWithTimeout enforces timeout → infinite loop returns success:false with timeout error, does not hang
+- [ ] sandbox is isolated → code cannot access process/require from outer scope
+- [ ] duration ≥ 0, memoryUsed ≥ 0 always present
+
+## Reviews (`src/reviews/index.ts` → `ReviewService`, better-sqlite3)
+- [ ] addReview assigns id, createdAt, flagged=false; returns full Review
+- [ ] addReview rejects rating outside 1-5
+- [ ] getReviews(pluginName) returns that plugin's reviews
+- [ ] getAverageRating excludes flagged reviews; 0 when none
+- [ ] flagReview(id) sets flagged=true
+- [ ] getFlaggedReviews returns only flagged
+- [ ] removeReview(id) deletes, returns true; false if absent
+- [ ] getReviewsByUser(userId) filters by user
+- [ ] getReviewCount(pluginName) counts reviews for plugin
+
+## Deps (`src/deps/index.ts` → `DepsService`)
+- [ ] buildTree builds nested DependencyNode using registry, terminates on cycles
+- [ ] detectCycles returns cycle paths or null when acyclic
+- [ ] hasCircularDependency true/false matching detectCycles
+- [ ] topologicalSort orders dependencies before dependents
+- [ ] flattenDependencies returns unique transitive dependency names
+
+## Integration (`src/index.ts` → `createMarketplace`)
+- [ ] exposes registry/resolver/runner/reviews/deps services
+- [ ] installPlugin validates name/version/entryPoint → throws on missing field
+- [ ] installPlugin registers, resolves deps, rejects on circular dep, executes entryPoint
+- [ ] installPlugin returns {resolved, result}
+
+## Build
+- [ ] npm run build clean
+- [ ] npm run lint clean
+- [ ] npm test passes
